      "en": "# Golang Samber Lo\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Domain:** `CODING` | **Source:** `samber/cc-skills-golang` | **License:** `MIT` | **Installs:** `39,516`\n\n## ⚡ Overview & Capabilities\nFunctional programming helpers for Golang using samber/lo — 500+ type-safe generic functions for slices, maps, channels, strings, math, tuples, and concurrency (Map, Filter, Reduce, GroupBy, Chunk, Flatten, Find, Uniq, etc.). Core immutable package (lo), concurrent variants (lo/parallel aka lop), in-place mutations (lo/mutable aka lom), lazy iterators (lo/it aka loi for Go 1.23+), and experimental SIMD (lo/exp/simd). Apply when using or adopting samber/lo, when the codebase imports github.com/samber/lo, or when implementing functional-style data transformations in Go. Not for streaming pipelines (→ See `samber/cc-skills-golang@golang-samber-ro` skill).\n\nThis skill delivers production-verified operational rules, architecture constraints, and executable guidelines directly integrated into your agent execution loop.\n\n## 🎯 Primary Use Cases\n- When implementing, debugging, or reviewing workflows related to **Golang Samber Lo**.\n- Enforcing domain best practices and eliminating hallucinated parameters.\n- Executing standard terminal and API actions via `npx skills add samber/cc-skills-golang --skill golang-samber-lo`.\n\n## 🛠️ Verification & Safety\n- **Supply Chain Safety:** Verified safe from supply-chain injection, telemetry leakage, and malicious dependencies.\n- **Agent Interoperability:** Compatible with all standard AI agent platforms including Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, and Gemini CLI.\n",
      "fa": "# Golang Samber Lo\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **حوزه:** `CODING` | **منبع:** `samber/cc-skills-golang` | **مجوز:** `MIT` | **دستور نصب:** `npx skills add samber/cc-skills-golang --skill golang-samber-lo`\n\n## ⚡ قابلیت‌ها و گایدلاین اجرایی\nاین مهارت الگوهای مهندسی و قواعد عملیاتی تاییدشده مرتبط با **Golang Samber Lo** را به دستیار هوشمند شما اضافه می‌کند.\n\n## 🎯 سناریوهای کاربرد\n- طراحی، پیاده‌سازی و بازبینی فرآیندهای مرتبط با **Golang Samber Lo**.\n- تثبیت اصول صنعتی و جلوگیری از پارامترهای نادرست در تعاملات کلاینت.\n- اجرای فرامین از طریق دستور استاندارد:\n```bash\nnpx skills add samber/cc-skills-golang --skill golang-samber-lo\n```\n"
