      "en": "# Sales Icp Definition\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Domain:** `MARKETING` | **Source:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **License:** `MIT` | **Installs:** `33,527`\n\n## ⚡ Overview & Capabilities\nDefines the company's ideal customer profile (ICP) at sales-leadership altitude - the firmographic, technographic, behavioral and intent criteria, a weighted scoring rubric with explicit disqualifiers, and the refresh cadence that targeting keys off. Works from closed-won/lost deal data, or from founder-led discovery when deal data is thin. Covers B2B account ICPs and the equivalent B2C demographic/psychographic profile. Use whenever the user mentions the ideal or target customer, buyer profile, \"who should we sell to\", or targeting that is too broad, even without the letters ICP. Do NOT use for TAM/SAM/SOM sizing (mbfinotti/sales-skills@sales-market-sizing) or account fit scoring (mbfinotti/sales-skills@sales-account-segmentation).\n\nThis skill delivers production-verified operational rules, architecture constraints, and executable guidelines directly integrated into your agent execution loop.\n\n## 🎯 Primary Use Cases\n- When implementing, debugging, or reviewing workflows related to **Sales Icp Definition**.\n- Enforcing domain best practices and eliminating hallucinated parameters.\n- Executing standard terminal and API actions via `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill sales-icp-definition`.\n\n## 🛠️ Verification & Safety\n- **Supply Chain Safety:** Verified safe from supply-chain injection, telemetry leakage, and malicious dependencies.\n- **Agent Interoperability:** Compatible with all standard AI agent platforms including Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, and Gemini CLI.\n",
      "fa": "# Sales Icp Definition\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **حوزه:** `MARKETING` | **منبع:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **مجوز:** `MIT` | **دستور نصب:** `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill sales-icp-definition`\n\n## ⚡ قابلیت‌ها و گایدلاین اجرایی\nاین مهارت الگوهای مهندسی و قواعد عملیاتی تاییدشده مرتبط با **Sales Icp Definition** را به دستیار هوشمند شما اضافه می‌کند.\n\n## 🎯 سناریوهای کاربرد\n- طراحی، پیاده‌سازی و بازبینی فرآیندهای مرتبط با **Sales Icp Definition**.\n- تثبیت اصول صنعتی و جلوگیری از پارامترهای نادرست در تعاملات کلاینت.\n- اجرای فرامین از طریق دستور استاندارد:\n```bash\nnpx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill sales-icp-definition\n```\n"
