      "en": "# Sales Kickoff\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Domain:** `DESIGN` | **Source:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **License:** `MIT` | **Installs:** `33,373`\n\n## ⚡ Overview & Capabilities\nBefore starting any sales project, and before answering a sales request that spans more than one sales topic or names no skill at all, run this router first. It routes the task to exactly one skill in the sales-skills collection, or says plainly that none fits, and bootstraps or resumes the project's shared sales-context.md artifact, producing a short-list plus an ordered skill chain. Fires on the state of the conversation rather than the subject matter, at a sales project start, at a periodic sales check-in or recurring sales review, on a mid-project re-route, or on any broad or ambiguous sales request such as \"which sales skill do I need\" or \"where do I start with sales\". Covers both altitudes, CRO-altitude planning (motion, ICP, market sizing, segmentation, tiering, org structure, quota, coverage, comp) and execution (outbound, cold calling, discovery, objections, MEDDPICC, recaps, call review, hiring, career). Run it even when sibling skills are already in daily use elsewhere.\n\nThis skill delivers production-verified operational rules, architecture constraints, and executable guidelines directly integrated into your agent execution loop.\n\n## 🎯 Primary Use Cases\n- When implementing, debugging, or reviewing workflows related to **Sales Kickoff**.\n- Enforcing domain best practices and eliminating hallucinated parameters.\n- Executing standard terminal and API actions via `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill sales-kickoff`.\n\n## 🛠️ Verification & Safety\n- **Supply Chain Safety:** Verified safe from supply-chain injection, telemetry leakage, and malicious dependencies.\n- **Agent Interoperability:** Compatible with all standard AI agent platforms including Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, and Gemini CLI.\n",
      "fa": "# Sales Kickoff\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **حوزه:** `DESIGN` | **منبع:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **مجوز:** `MIT` | **دستور نصب:** `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill sales-kickoff`\n\n## ⚡ قابلیت‌ها و گایدلاین اجرایی\nاین مهارت الگوهای مهندسی و قواعد عملیاتی تاییدشده مرتبط با **Sales Kickoff** را به دستیار هوشمند شما اضافه می‌کند.\n\n## 🎯 سناریوهای کاربرد\n- طراحی، پیاده‌سازی و بازبینی فرآیندهای مرتبط با **Sales Kickoff**.\n- تثبیت اصول صنعتی و جلوگیری از پارامترهای نادرست در تعاملات کلاینت.\n- اجرای فرامین از طریق دستور استاندارد:\n```bash\nnpx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill sales-kickoff\n```\n"
