      "en": "# Cold Email Deliverability\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Domain:** `MARKETING` | **Source:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **License:** `MIT` | **Installs:** `32,417`\n\n## ⚡ Overview & Capabilities\nReviews a cold email draft and its sending setup for deliverability - SPF/DKIM/DMARC alignment, sender reputation and complaint risk, body mechanics (length, links, images, tracking pixels, HTML vs plain text, opt-out), and legal compliance by region. Covers B2B cold outbound and B2C bulk/lifecycle mail. Use whenever the user mentions the spam folder, blacklisting, domain warmup, inbox placement, bounce rates, DMARC, or \"why are my emails not landing\", even without the word deliverability. Do NOT use for subject lines (mbfinotti/sales-skills@cold-email-subject-line-tester) or cadence (mbfinotti/sales-skills@sales-outbound-sequence). Hygiene and compliance only, never spam-filter evasion.\n\nThis skill delivers production-verified operational rules, architecture constraints, and executable guidelines directly integrated into your agent execution loop.\n\n## 🎯 Primary Use Cases\n- When implementing, debugging, or reviewing workflows related to **Cold Email Deliverability**.\n- Enforcing domain best practices and eliminating hallucinated parameters.\n- Executing standard terminal and API actions via `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill cold-email-deliverability`.\n\n## 🛠️ Verification & Safety\n- **Supply Chain Safety:** Verified safe from supply-chain injection, telemetry leakage, and malicious dependencies.\n- **Agent Interoperability:** Compatible with all standard AI agent platforms including Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, and Gemini CLI.\n",
      "fa": "# Cold Email Deliverability\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **حوزه:** `MARKETING` | **منبع:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **مجوز:** `MIT` | **دستور نصب:** `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill cold-email-deliverability`\n\n## ⚡ قابلیت‌ها و گایدلاین اجرایی\nاین مهارت الگوهای مهندسی و قواعد عملیاتی تاییدشده مرتبط با **Cold Email Deliverability** را به دستیار هوشمند شما اضافه می‌کند.\n\n## 🎯 سناریوهای کاربرد\n- طراحی، پیاده‌سازی و بازبینی فرآیندهای مرتبط با **Cold Email Deliverability**.\n- تثبیت اصول صنعتی و جلوگیری از پارامترهای نادرست در تعاملات کلاینت.\n- اجرای فرامین از طریق دستور استاندارد:\n```bash\nnpx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill cold-email-deliverability\n```\n"
