      "en": "# Negotiation Concession Planner\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Domain:** `MARKETING` | **Source:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **License:** `MIT` | **Installs:** `32,308`\n\n## ⚡ Overview & Capabilities\nBuilds a pre-negotiation concession plan for a pricing or contract conversation - every tradeable lever priced by cost-to-us vs value-to-them, tiered, each give paired with a required reciprocal get and its approval level, plus a BATNA-based walk-away. Covers B2B (terms, scope, service, risk, price protection) and B2C (bundles, financing, trade allowance). Use whenever the user mentions a discount request, procurement, redlines, give-get trades, walk-away point, or \"the buyer wants 20% off\", even without the word negotiation. Do NOT use for quantifying the value (mbfinotti/sales-skills@deal-value-calc) or scripting price rebuttals (mbfinotti/sales-skills@sales-objection-handling).\n\nThis skill delivers production-verified operational rules, architecture constraints, and executable guidelines directly integrated into your agent execution loop.\n\n## 🎯 Primary Use Cases\n- When implementing, debugging, or reviewing workflows related to **Negotiation Concession Planner**.\n- Enforcing domain best practices and eliminating hallucinated parameters.\n- Executing standard terminal and API actions via `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill negotiation-concession-planner`.\n\n## 🛠️ Verification & Safety\n- **Supply Chain Safety:** Verified safe from supply-chain injection, telemetry leakage, and malicious dependencies.\n- **Agent Interoperability:** Compatible with all standard AI agent platforms including Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, and Gemini CLI.\n",
      "fa": "# Negotiation Concession Planner\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **حوزه:** `MARKETING` | **منبع:** `mbfinotti/sales-skills` | **مجوز:** `MIT` | **دستور نصب:** `npx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill negotiation-concession-planner`\n\n## ⚡ قابلیت‌ها و گایدلاین اجرایی\nاین مهارت الگوهای مهندسی و قواعد عملیاتی تاییدشده مرتبط با **Negotiation Concession Planner** را به دستیار هوشمند شما اضافه می‌کند.\n\n## 🎯 سناریوهای کاربرد\n- طراحی، پیاده‌سازی و بازبینی فرآیندهای مرتبط با **Negotiation Concession Planner**.\n- تثبیت اصول صنعتی و جلوگیری از پارامترهای نادرست در تعاملات کلاینت.\n- اجرای فرامین از طریق دستور استاندارد:\n```bash\nnpx skills add mbfinotti/sales-skills --skill negotiation-concession-planner\n```\n"
